  "what_was_done_instead": "attempt_id = the execution_id's stable prefix where an execution_id exists (OW-10: attempt_id is the STABLE LOGICAL JOB), and map_key only for the 17 pre-execution-id executions, whose map_keys are attempt-shaped. This yields 63 distinct attempt ids, all 63 of which are receipt attempts, with 0 preserved ids outside the receipts.",
